@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to add a new industry on the map
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows map and asks for the coordinates
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : types the coordinates
    activate System

        System --> Employee : receives data, confirms the availability of the coordinates \nand shows the available industries to be created
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System :chooses which type to build
    activate System

        System --> Employee : receives the chosen type and shows all data \nand requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms data and accepts or cancels the order
    activate System

        System --> Employee : displays operation success and creates the \n requested industry on the map
    deactivate System
@enduml